      "summary": "ClearInvoice speaks in clean, practical sentences about billing that does not hurt. It promises less admin and says what it saves.",
      "dos": [
        "Name the billing task and the saving",
        "Use short verbs: bill, chase, reconcile",
        "Back claims with a number"
      ],
      "donts": [
        "Do not use finance jargon",
        "Avoid empty promises like effortless",
        "Never hide pricing"
      ]
    },
